    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Make a Guile melee attack that can Daze your target. Gain 2 Boons if you started Hidden.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Guile</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One adjacent enemy.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>Use an ordinary melee weapon (Bulk 1), supplied on learning if needed.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Attack / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Make a Guile melee attack. If you began Hidden, gain 2 Boons to the attack.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>5 physical damage.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>5 physical damage and Dazed 1.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>7 physical damage and Dazed 2.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785/design/cards/a-shadow-at-the-heart.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/a-shadow-at-the-heart.md</a> at <code>24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785</code>.</p></section>",
